# 🌦️ Live Weather App

A sleek and responsive web app to check real-time weather conditions using city names. Built with HTML, CSS, and JavaScript, powered by a public weather API.

🔗 **Live Demo**: [https://inspiring-taffy-ac5869.netlify.app](https://inspiring-taffy-ac5869.netlify.app)

---

## ✨ Features

- 🔍 Search by city name
- 🌡️ Displays current temperature
- 💧 Shows humidity and wind speed
- 🌇 Clean, modern UI with gradient background
- 📱 Fully responsive design

---

