![Weather App Screenshot](f6469abe-af30-4e09-821c-2684e76b5bc0.png)

---

## 🛠️ Tech Stack

- **HTML5**
- **CSS3** (with Flexbox and gradients)
- **JavaScript** (DOM manipulation, Fetch API)
- **Netlify** (for deployment)

